sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as Analyst
    participant W as webapp
    participant M as mongodb
    participant R as redis
    participant F as watched folder
    participant L as logstash
    participant E as elasticsearch
    A->>W: POST /api/v1/files (file)
    W->>W: check extension, size, structure
    alt file invalid
        W-->>A: 400 with a clear error message
    else file valid
        W->>M: insert file document (status uploaded)
        W->>F: save the file as fileId__name
        W->>R: LPUSH queue:ingestion fileId
        W-->>A: 202 with fileId and first 10 lines
    end
    L->>F: detect the new file and read it
    L->>L: parse, date, mutate, geoip, tags
    L->>E: bulk index into shopflow-logs
    W->>E: count logs where file_id = fileId
    W->>M: update file (status indexed, logs_count)
